   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thanks, Hadley. My brain was in neutral yesterday. The problem is clearly in base::months() being appallingly slow.<br><br></div>I took a ~10% sample of the data to speed up testing.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> last_file_date </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input_files$as_at_date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">170165</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">74</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">time</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   d </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     ungroup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     arrange_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> as_at_date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># order rows by as-at date within entity</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     group_by_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2 </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># check each entity</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   user  system elapsed <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.817</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.000</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.818</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">time</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   d </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     ungroup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     arrange_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> as_at_date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># order rows by as-at date within entity</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     group_by_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># check each entity</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     mutate_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       first_date </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> first</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">as_at_date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># first observed as-at date for this entity</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       last_date </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">last</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">as_at_date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># last observed as-at date for this entity</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       last_date_ok </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> last_date </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> last_file_date</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">       n_dates </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d2 <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   user  system elapsed <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.798</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.000</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.799</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">time</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   d </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     ungro